        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3 text-gray-900">What electronic signing means</h2>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">When you choose to sign electronically, you indicate your intention to sign the document presented to you using the selected electronic signature. Read the entire document and resolve questions with the other party before submitting your signature.</p>
