        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Retain a complete, readable copy of your agreement and associated records. If a record is unavailable or unreadable, contact the sender to obtain it before relying on electronic delivery. Do not assume that an online account will remain an indefinite archive.</p>
